text.en:
The territorial jurisdiction of the Municipality of Luna, Province of Kalinga-Apayao, is hereby
expanded to include a certain portion of public land within the classified alienable and disposable area situated
three kilometers south of the Poblacion and identified as within Sheet No. I, Project 7-D, Luna,
Kalinga-Apayao, and more particularly described as follows:
"A parcel of land situated in the Municipality of Luna, Province of Kalinga-Apayao, bounded on the North by
project No. 5, Block D, A or D, certified July 25, 1925 per L.C. 552 on the N.E. by Project No. 13, Block V,
A or D certified February 21, 1923 per L.C. 30; on the E.S.,W, NW by portion of Project No 7-D, A or D,
Block I (pending certification). Beginning at a point marked 1 on plan being identical to FZ corner 1 of A or
D Block D, Project No. 5 of Tawit, Apayao.
Thence : Following branch of Cr. upstream 520.00 M. to point 2;
Thence : S 3_E., 1,800.00 M. to point 3;
Thence : S 80_W, 1,300.00 M. to point 4;
Thence : N 82_W, 1,350.00 M. to point 5;
Thence : Following trail in a general northeasterly direction about 1,000.00 M. to point 6;
Thence : N. 25_E., 1,130.00 M. to point 7;
Thence : N. 64_E., 200.00 M. to point 8;
Thence : S 5_E., 200.00 M. to point 9;
Thence : S. 5_E., 130.00 M. to point 10;
Thence : Following trail in a general southeasterly Direction about 200.00 M. to point 11;

Thence : S. 62_E., 180.00 M. to point 12;
Thence : N. 82_E., 120.00 M. to point 13;
Thence : N. 7_W, 250.00 M. to point 14;
Thence : S. 54_E, 400.00 M. to point 15;
Thence : N. 26_E, 650.00 M. to point of beginning, containing an approximate area of FOUR HUNDRED
HECTARES (400). All corners referred to are indicated on the plan."
